At least one endpoint of **{{ labels.availability_service }}** failed its check
or scrape.

Open the service highlight and inspect its related endpoints. Check the failing
endpoint's health check, HTTP response code and probe duration, then investigate
its application, network path or TLS certificate. Check the endpoint's `up`
metric and scraper logs when its Blackbox metrics are missing.

Every labeled URL is required for service availability. If a URL is an optional
dependency, monitor it separately without the service's `availability_service`
label.
